ZnRtbHRHVDNVa0h3QXpfN3hiYXExMGkzbGpVTHN0WTd1M2d4VXlaZGRpRkJ2VFRvSmYtY2ZjQV96Ync?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":12},{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1130310/000113031026000008/cnp-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"This combined Form 10-K is filed separately by three registrants: CenterPoint Energy, Inc., CenterPoint Energy Houston Electric, LLC and CenterPoint Energy Resources Corp. Information contained herein relating to any individual Registrant is filed by such Registrant solely on its own behalf. No Registrant makes any representation as to information relating to the other Registrants or the subsidiaries of CenterPoint Energy, Inc. other than itself or its subsidiaries. Except as discussed in Note 12 to the consolidated financial statements, no Registrant has an obligation in respect of any other Registrant's debt securities, and holders of such debt securities should not consider the financial resources or results of operations of any Registrant other than the obligor in making a decision with respect to such securities.","zh":"此合併表 10-K 由三位註冊人分別提交：CenterPoint Energy, Inc.、CenterPoint Energy Houston Electric, LLC 和 CenterPoint Energy Resources Corp。此處包含的與任何個人註冊人相關的資訊僅由該註冊人代表其自己提交。除其本身或其子公司外，任何註冊人均不會就與 CenterPoint Energy, Inc. 的其他註冊人或子公司相關的資訊做出任何陳述。除合併財務報表附註 12 所討論的情況外，任何註冊人均不對任何其他註冊人的債務證券承擔義務，且此類債務證券的持有人在就此類證券做出決定時不應考慮義務人以外的任何註冊人的財務資源或經營業績。"},{"en":"The discussion of CenterPoint Energy's consolidated financial information includes the financial results of Houston Electric and CERC. Where appropriate, information relating to a specific Registrant has been segregated and labeled as such. Unless the context indicates otherwise, specific references to Houston Electric and CERC also pertain to CenterPoint Energy. In this combined Form 10-K, the terms \"our,\" \"we\" and \"us\" are used as abbreviated references to CenterPoint Energy, Inc. together with its consolidated subsidiaries, including Houston Electric and CERC, unless otherwise stated.","zh":"CenterPoint Energy 綜合財務資訊的討論包括休士頓電力公司和 CERC 的財務表現。在適當的情況下，與特定註冊人相關的資訊已被隔離並標記。除非上下文另有說明，否則對休士頓電力公司和 CERC 的具體提及也適用於 CenterPoint Energy。除非另有說明，在此合併表 10-K 中，術語「我們的」和「我們」用作 CenterPoint Energy, Inc. 及其合併子公司（包括休士頓電力公司和 CERC）的縮寫。"},{"en":"CenterPoint Energy is a public utility holding company. CenterPoint Energy's operating subsidiaries own and operate electric transmission, distribution and generation facilities and natural gas distribution systems.","zh":"CenterPoint Energy 是一家公用事業控股公司。 CenterPoint Energy 的營運子公司擁有並經營輸電、配電和發電設施以及天然氣分配系統。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Houston Electric serves nearly all of the Houston/Galveston metropolitan area near the Texas Gulf Coast. Houston Electric's customers consist of REPs, which sell electricity to metered customers in Houston Electric's certificated service area, and municipalities, electric cooperatives and other distribution companies located outside Houston Electric's certificated service area. Each REP is licensed by, and must meet minimum creditworthiness criteria established by, the PUCT. Houston Electric does not have long-term contracts with any of its customers, but rather operates using a continuous billing cycle, with meter readings being conducted and invoices being distributed to REPs each business day. For information regarding Houston Electric's major customers, see Note 16 to the consolidated financial statements.","zh":"休士頓電力服務於德州墨西哥灣沿岸附近的幾乎所有休士頓/加爾維斯頓都會區。休士頓電力公司的客戶包括向休士頓電力公司認證服務區域內的計量客戶銷售電力的 REP，以及位於休士頓電力公司認證服務區域之外的市政當局、電力合作社和其他配電公司。每個 REP 均獲得 PUCT 許可，且必須符合 PUCT 制定的最低信譽標準。休士頓電力公司沒有與任何客戶簽訂長期合同，而是採用連續計費週期運營，每個工作日進行抄表並將發票分發給 REP。有關休士頓電力主要客戶的資訊，請參閱合併財務報表附註 16。"},{"en":"The table below reflects the number of REPs and metered customers in Houston Electric's service area as of December 31, 2025:","zh":"下表反映了截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日休士頓電力服務區域內的 REP 和計量客戶數量："}],"competition":[{"en":"There are no other electric transmission and distribution utilities in Houston Electric's service area. For another provider of transmission and distribution services to provide such services in Houston Electric's territory, it would be required to obtain a CCN from the PUCT and, depending on the location of the facilities, may also be required to obtain franchises from one or more municipalities. Houston Electric is not aware of any other party intending to enter this business in its service area at this time. Distributed generation (i.e., power generation located at or near the point of consumption) could result in a reduction of demand for Houston Electric's distribution services but has not been a significant factor to date.","zh":"休士頓電力公司的服務區域內沒有其他輸電和配電設施。對於在休士頓電力公司境內提供此類服務的另一家輸電和配電服務供應商來說，需要從 PUCT 獲得 CCN，並且根據設施的位置，可能還需要從一個或多個城市獲得特許經營權。休士頓電力目前不知道有任何其他方有意進入其服務區域內的這項業務。分散式發電（即位於或接近用電點的發電）可能會導致對休士頓電力配電服務的需求減少，但迄今為止還不是一個重要因素。"},{"en":"Houston Electric's revenues are primarily derived from rates that it collects from each REP based on the amount of electricity it delivers on behalf of that REP. Houston Electric's revenues and results of operations are subject to seasonality, weather conditions and other changes in electricity usage, with revenues generally being higher during the warmer months when more electricity is used for cooling purposes.","zh":"休士頓電力公司的收入主要來自於它根據代表每個 REP 提供的電量向該 REP 收取的費率。休士頓電力公司的收入和經營業績受到季節性、天氣條件和其他用電量變化的影響，在溫暖的月份，當更多的電力用於冷卻目的時，收入通常會更高。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electric","val":4866000000,"zh":"電的"},{"name":"Electric","val":4866000000,"zh":"電動部門"},{"name":"Natural Gas","val":4503000000,"zh":"天然氣部門"}],"total":9357000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retail Gas Sales","val":4266000000,"zh":"零售天然氣銷售"},{"name":"Electric Delivery","val":4109000000,"zh":"電力輸送"},{"name":"Retail Electric Sales","val":736000000,"zh":"零售電力銷售"},{"name":"Energy Products Or Services","val":216000000,"zh":"能源產品或服務"},{"name":"Wholesale Electric Sales","val":19000000,"zh":"批發電力銷售"},{"name":"Gas Transportationand Processing","val":11000000,"zh":"天然氣運輸和加工"}],"total":9357000000}},"peers":["CMS","NI","ETR","AEE","FE"]}}